{"title":"2005 iTest Problems/Problem 40","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_40&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/8/32828569779d062498e195dc553a237317786434.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ITEST + AHSIMC = 6666CS$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"259\" height=\"16\" />. Each letter represents a unique digit from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. How many solutions of the form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/e/8fed68aac18c74eaf0967025ed7d1186b393768c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(C,A,S,H)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"95\" height=\"20\" /> exist?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_40&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We quickly see that either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/2/7329afa7a69b85b7b6a3dfdc63af5bcdd6714882.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S=7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"47\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/5/0b581f957f43dea7fafc17feea600971380c9f4c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"47\" height=\"14\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/2/7329afa7a69b85b7b6a3dfdc63af5bcdd6714882.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S=7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"47\" height=\"14\" />, then we realize that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/9/a29bb79a3ae675aa6299000e7be0fb0f4dd8cfec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C=8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" />. We then realize that to make sure that the problem condition holds, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/0/af04466ac38b7b0d0f451b3280c38f861ea13822.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A=6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" />. Plugging in these to find the remaining values yields three solutions: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/6/9e6604d9df8c87804d42cdb6f925b8d2e259c906.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(8,6,7,4), (8,6,7,3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"159\" height=\"20\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/2/612954b183d193e5bbe8f3ea7b5648773915a612.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(8,6,7,1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"77\" height=\"20\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/5/0b581f957f43dea7fafc17feea600971380c9f4c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"47\" height=\"14\" />,<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is forced to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/2/d72c739bd8c2b60ef756afaf71e48afd30a74938.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A=5$\" width=\"46\" height=\"13\" />. Plugging these in eventually yields the solution <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/4/8349d917fba3c5b56218521320d190eccbeb47cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1,5,3,7)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"77\" height=\"20\" />. Thus our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/4/6c4c6c07150a0f6e56b0a6e198d1d19155dfe96c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"22\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_40&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest\" title=\"2005 iTest\">2005 iTest</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems\" title=\"2005 iTest Problems\">(Problems</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2005 iTest Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key)</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_39\" title=\"2005 iTest Problems/Problem 39\">Problem 39</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_41\" title=\"2005 iTest Problems/Problem 41\">Problem 41</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2005 iTest Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2005 iTest Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"